TITLE Albite kinetics with H2S gas and Fe redox at 200C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    Fe(+3) 0.004
    Fe(+2) 0.004
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
Albite
    -m0 1
    -m 1
    -parms 1.0 10
    -steps 1000 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -step true
    -time true
    -totals Fe(+3) Fe(+2) Fe S(-2) Na Al Si
END
